      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The shantak's scales are covered in slippery slime, so the shantak gains a +3 circumstance bonus to Escape.</p>\n<p>A creature mounted on a shantak takes double the normal circumstance penalty to Reflex saves (-4 instead of -2 in most cases) while mounted.</p>",
